# Build output
*.exe
*.dll
*.o
*.a
build/

# The submission archive and any staging folder for it. The finished zip is
# 82 MB, most of it the Stockfish binary, and GitHub rejects pushes over 100 MB
# anyway - it is built from the whitelist in docs/PLAN.md when needed.
*.zip

# Chess engine binary (shipped with the submission, not tracked here)
stockfish*

# Tool and editor local state - never part of the project
.claude/
.vs/
*.bak
*~

# One-off environment setup leftovers
setup_chess.bat
setup_log.txt
setup_done.marker

# NOTE: .vscode/ and CLAUDE.md ARE tracked, on purpose. Git is the off-machine
# backup, and anything ignored here is not backed up. Both are excluded from
# the submission zip manually instead - see docs/PLAN.md Phase 7.
